* ideal_opamp_rr_single.lib
* Behavioral rail-to-rail single op-amp model
* (MCP6001T, NCS20071, OpAmp_Single_TSOP5_R2R)
*
* Output clamped within 50 mV of supply rails.
*
* Pin order:  inm inp vcc vee out
*   (same as ideal_opamp_single.lib — drop-in replacement)
*
* KiCad Sim.Pins for 5-pin SOT23-5:
*   1=OUT, 2=V-, 3=IN+, 4=IN-, 5=V+
*   Sim.Pins = "4 3 5 2 1"

.subckt IDEAL_OPAMP_RR_SINGLE inm inp vcc vee out
Rin inp inm 1G
B1 out 0 V = max(V(vee)+0.05, min(V(vcc)-0.05, 100000*(V(inp)-V(inm))))
.ends IDEAL_OPAMP_RR_SINGLE
